  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diocese of Manzini AIDS programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#xB7; To continue to build AIDS teams within the Diocese, aimed at building the Church&apos;s capacity to respond to the AIDS epidemic. 
&#xB7; With the help of trained group leaders, to continue to establish peer education groups and programmes targeted at young people. 
&#xB7; To provide training, education, care and support for the Anti-AIDS team members and other volunteers. 
&#xB7; To develop locally and disseminate culturally sensitive materials on sexuality and AIDS within the framework of the teachings of the Catholic Church. 
&#xB7; To conduct seminars/ workshops on AIDS related topics for parish, school and other interested groups. 
&#xB7; To continue to play a national collaborative role to combat AIDS through networking with other concerned bodies. 
&#xB7; To encourage the establishment of self-sustaining activities for families and individuals affected by AIDS. This will have to be carried out in conjunction with other groups competent in these areas.</narrative>
  </description>
